OL,3,GNEWSAInquest opens into 'Putney Pusher'
OL,4,Asuspect's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man suspected of knocking a woman
OL,7,Finto the path of a bus on Putney Bridge
OL,8,Fwas found dead by his brother-in-law
OL,9,Fafter missing a family meal, his
OL,10,Finquest has heard.
OL,12,FNicholas Brandram, 44, was discovered
OL,13,Fat his home in Chiswick on 15
OL,14,FSeptember, West London Coroner's Court
OL,15,Fwas told.
OL,17,FHe had been arrested in June on
OL,18,Fsuspicion of attempted grievous bodily
OL,19,Fharm in relation to the incident of May
OL,20,F2017, when a woman was shoved into the
OL,21,Froad by a jogger. His family say he was
OL,22,Fnot involved.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
