OL,3,GNEWSAInquest opens into 'Putney Pusher'
OL,4,Asuspect's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpening and adjourning the inquest,
OL,7,FWest London coroner Melanie Lee said
OL,8,Fshe had been told of a referral to the
OL,9,FIndependent Office of Police Conduct
OL,10,Fand was suspending the hearing pending
OL,11,Fthe outcome of its inquiry.
